    "text":  "VANTA MOTORWERKE â€” EST. 1968 / RESTORED 2026\nSCROLL TO UNVEIL\nVANTA\nSPEC\nDRIVE\nDETAIL\nFINISH\nRESERVE\nMOTOR IDLE ON\n\nSTUDIO 07 â€” SHEET LIFT 00:00:04\n\nREDISCOVER\nthe CLASSICS\n\nNine hundred kilos of hand-formed aluminium. One engine we refuse to explain. The Model 03 does not ask to be liked.\n\n30X\nSTIFFER MONOCOQUE\n001/150\nALLOCATION\nÃ˜\nDRIVER AIDS\nUNBREAKABLE\nUNSTOPPABLE\nUNRIVALED\nSCROLL\n\n02 â€” HOMOLOGATION\n\nNUMBERS WE\nnever ROUNDED.\n\nMeasured at Bonneville, 14Â Â°C, tyres at 2.1Â bar. No launch mode. No excuses.\n\n01\n0\nBHP\nTwin-charged 4.4 flat-crank\n02\n0\ns\n0â€“60 MPH\nRolling start, one occupant\n03\n0\nMPH V-MAX\nDerestricted, salt-verified\n04\n0\nLB-FT\nPlateaued from 2 100 rpm\nVANTA\nVANTA on the salt flats\n\nACCELERATION\n\n0â€“60\n\n2.6 seconds. Repeatably. On a surface that gives nothing back.\n\nRANGE\n\n500\n\nMiles between fills. Hydrogen, compressed to 700 bar.\n\nREDLINE\n\n+10K\n\nRPM. Titanium rods. A noise you will feel in your sternum.\n\nBONNEVILLE â€” 03:14 â€” AMBIENT 9Â Â°C\n\n04 â€” DETAIL\n\nEVERY PART\nyou WILL TOUCH.\n01\nFORGED BRONZE 20â€³\nCarbon-ceramic, 410 mm. Cross-drilled by hand, then measured twice.\n02\nSADDLE-TAN CABIN\nFour analogue dials, amber-lit. One switch you are told never to use.\n03\nOBSIDIAN BODY\nAluminium over a bonded tub. Seven coats, none of them glossy.\n04\nNOCTURNE SIGNATURE\nThe only part of it most people will ever see.\n\n05 â€” FINISH\n\nCHOOSE THE\none YOU KEEP.\n\nFour finishes leave the shop. Two of them are matte. None of them are optional extras.\n\nVNT-03 / OBS-MT\n\nOBSIDIAN MATTE\nEMBER FLARE\nBRONZE FORGE\nNOCTURNE BLACKOUT\nOBSIDIAN MATTE\n\nSeven coats of un-lacquered black. It eats the light in the room and gives nothing back.\n\nPAINT MASS\n18 kg\nPREMIUM\nStandard\nLEAD TIME\n11 months\n\nSO FAR â€” NOTHING HAS\n\nUnbreakable\nU\nN\nB\nR\nE\nA\nK\nA\nB\nL\nE\n\nTwo hundred thousand test miles. Salt, gravel, one volcano.\nWe have not yet found the end of it.\n\n07 â€” ALLOCATION\n\nONE HUNDRED AND FIFTY.\nthen THE TOOLING BURNS.\n\nA refundable deposit of Â£25 000 holds a build slot and a colour. Deliveries open Q3 2027 from the Nevada shop.\n\nRESERVEÂ YOURS\nREMAINING\n112 of 150\nDEPOSIT\nÂ£25 000, refundable\nBUILD\nNevada, 11 months\nUNBREAKABLE\nâ—†\nUNSTOPPABLE\nâ—†\nUNRIVALED\nâ—†\nVANTA MODEL 03 NOCTURNE\nâ—†\nUNBREAKABLE\nâ—†\nUNSTOPPABLE\nâ—†\nUNRIVALED\nâ—†\nVANTA MODEL 03 NOCTURNE\nâ—†\n\nVANTA\n\nMotorwerke, Building 07, Wendover NV. Hand-built to order since 1968.\n\nMODEL\n\nHomologation\nSalt programme\nFinishes\n\nCONTACT\n\nallocation@vanta.example\n+1 775 000 0003\n\nLEGAL\n\nFigures are manufacturer estimates for a car that does not have a warranty. Fictional brand, built for a scroll-craft showcase.\n\nÂ© 2026 VANTA MOTORWERKE",
